    "FriendlyName": "Cesium for Unreal",
    "Description": "An open-source Unreal Engine plugin for 3D geospatial visualization, streaming real-world 3D Tiles, photogrammetry, high-resolution terrain and global imagery with sub-millimeter precision anywhere on Earth.",
